          %h2#judgmental_equality_of_contexts Judgmental equality of contexts
          %p
            In some
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dependent+type+theories"} dependent type theories
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/contexts"} contexts
