              \-
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi Γ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Gamma
              and
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi Γ
                    %mo ′
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Gamma'
              are judgmentally equal contexts.
          %p
            There are reflexivity, symmetry, and transitivity rules making judgmental equality for contexts an
